@startuml 11-sequence-transaction-service
title transaction-service - Diagrama de secuencia

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Cliente\n(Postman)" as User
participant "account-service /\ncredit-service" as Caller
participant "MovementController\n(inbound adapter)" as Controller
participant "MovementCommandService\n/ MovementQueryService" as Service
participant "MovementRepositoryPort\n+ MongoAdapter" as Repo
database "MongoDB\nmovement_db" as DB

== 1. Registrar movimiento (POST /api/v1/movements) - interno ==
Caller -> Controller : POST /movements\n{productId, productType, movementType, amount, currency}
Controller -> Service : register(command)
Service -> Repo : save(movement)
Repo -> DB : insert movement
DB --> Repo : documento creado
Repo --> Service : Movement
Service --> Controller : RegisterMovementResult (interno)
Controller --> Caller : 201 Created + Movement

== 2. Consultar movimientos de un producto (GET /api/v1/movements) ==
User -> Controller : GET /movements?productId={id}&productType=BANK_ACCOUNT\n&limit=50&cursor=...
Controller -> Service : findAll(filter, cursorPageQuery)
Service -> Repo : findAll(filter, cursorPageQuery)
Repo -> DB : find({productId}) sort createdAt desc, id desc\nlimit N (cursor = createdAt + id)
DB --> Repo : documentos
Repo --> Service : Flowable<Movement>
Service -> Service : arma MovementPage\n(pide limit+1 para calcular nextCursor)
Service --> Controller : Single<MovementPage>
Controller --> User : 200 OK + cabecera X-Next-Cursor\n(application/json o application/x-ndjson)

== 3. Administrar movimientos (PUT / DELETE /api/v1/movements/{id}) - interno ==
User -> Controller : PUT o DELETE /movements/{id}
Controller -> Service : update(id, command) / delete(id)
Service -> Repo : findById(id)
Repo -> DB : find({_id})
DB --> Repo : documento o vacio
Repo --> Service : Maybe<Movement>
alt no existe
  Service --> Controller : ResourceNotFoundException
  Controller --> User : 404 Not Found
else existe
  Service -> Repo : save(movement) / deleteById(id)
  Repo -> DB : replace / delete
  DB --> Repo : OK
  Service --> Controller : Single<Movement> / Completable
  Controller --> User : 200 OK / 204 No Content
end

note over User, DB
  RegisterMovementResult es interno al caso de uso.
  El controlador devuelve su campo Movement, no el envoltorio.
  Las rutas de escritura son internas/administrativas.
  El contador mensual de movimientos vive en account-service.
end note

@enduml
